From: =?UTF-8?q?Erik=20Spr=C3=A5ng?= <sprang@webrtc.org>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:09:17 +0200
Subject: Check libyuv return values in VideoFrameBuffer conversions
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Return nullptr from ToI420() and CropAndScale() when the underlying
libyuv conversion fails, as documented on VideoFrameBuffer::ToI420(),
and use RTC_CHECK_EQ on libyuv copy, rotation, and scaling helpers.

Bug: webrtc:574312303
Change-Id: Ie236328267f1cd1a2e526f0f2d51b0770f0bf9fe
Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/509461
Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy <ilnik@webrtc.org>
Commit-Queue: Erik Språng <sprang@webrtc.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48944}

